{"title":"Posting through it is bipartisan","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/posting-through-it-is-bipartisan","date":1749831842000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you’re kettled by riot police and/or waiting for nuclear annihilation.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/0946d658-0d55-4b7b-adcc-38c755a71131/GettyImages-2219267571.jpg?t=1749807229\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by Mario Tama/Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, Elon Musk <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/musk-says-he-regrets-some-posts-he-made-about-trump-2025-06-11/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">apologized</a> for his angry posts about President Trump from last week. But fans of politicians Posting Through It have plenty of other options. On top of illegally <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/06/12/politics/trump-national-guard-california-breyer?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">sending the National Guard</a> to protests in Los Angeles, Trump has <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c1ld3pzg2n2o?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">lit up Truth Social</a> with insults to California Gov. Gavin Newsom — looks like he won't be the next <a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/news/fault-lines/what-gavin-newsoms-embarrassing-podcast-suggests-about-the-democratic-party?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">right wing guest</a> on Newsom's podcast. Meanwhile, Vice President JD Vance reportedly needed to be <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2025/06/07/trump-musk-vance/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">kept on a leash</a> from attacking Musk on X, so he could focus on targets like the ABC news anchor who was <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/terry-moran-abc-news-stephen-miller-3a0f54c0cc0b255130747a57ecee9cdd?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">fired for posting</a> that Trump and Stephen Miller are evil. Posting is truly bipartisan, though, since even a senator being <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/12/los-angeles-protests-alex-padilla-kristi-noem?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">handcuffed</a> is inspiring way more <a href=\"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/what-lawmakers-said-about-sen-padilla-being-forcibly-removed-from-dhs-news-conference?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">posting</a> than <a href=\"https://prospect.org/politics/2025-06-13-alex-padilla-assault-senate-democrats-genius-act/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">any official action</a> from the rest of the Senate. Maybe they didn’t see the “<a href=\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2025/06/09/army-parade-tank-hang-fauci-bill-gates-graffiti/84112187007/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">Hang Fauci and Bill Gates</a>” parade video before it got deleted.</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/kcrossvine-art/785898981994676224?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">“Brother please this is ultra bad for my coins”</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/rogueshunt/status/1932257615108862127?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">A sadly deleted X post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/creatine_cycle/status/1933370921152348161?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">Some good doomscrolling advice</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/chiweethedog/status/1933043691486323102?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">A good hypothetical Bluesky post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/ashinchina/status/1932789388704125293?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">喷水战士 aka diarrhea warrior</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/speedlimit15/786069965539360768?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">A good Tumblr post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@erik_ruof/video/7514776220354071851?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">The Punisher and Daredevil debate size vs. girth</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/rongzhi/785476958874206208/english-added-by-me?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">A good Douyin video</a> </p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/phonybone/status/1932944399086071950?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">A good post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/zeitghost/785814514208751616/i-dont-normally-repost-instagram-shit-but-the?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">Phenomenal car shape</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/grok/status/1933329419109806587?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\" target=\"_blank\">A very normal reaction to The State Of Things</a></p></li></ul><p></p><div><hr /><div><h2> Subscribe to Premium to read the rest. </h2><p> Become a paying subscriber of Premium to get access to this post and other subscriber-only content. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/upgrade?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\">Upgrade</a> Translation missing: en.app.shared.conjuction.or <a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/login?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=posting-through-it-is-bipartisan\">Sign In</a></p><div><div><h3> A subscription gets you </h3></div><ul><li> Paywalled weekend issue </li><li> Monthly Garbage Intelligence report </li><li> Discord access </li><li> Discounts on merch and events </li></ul></div></div></div></div><div><br /><hr /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.beehiiv.com/?utm_campaign=936c97c6-5385-4968-94b0-ede54dc81097&amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;utm_source=garbage_day\">Powered by beehiiv</a></div></div>","author":"Ryan BroderickAdam Bumas","siteTitle":"Garbage Day","siteHash":"f6f2268f28b352c16d6836ba0dcf62d1334588ef4ccbdcbdd896fc6dd07bbcb7","entryHash":"ebd81b0a82f3df441aaed16a6f6e577624ec3bd84e05bbf49345415f8c397c5e","category":"Sites"}